            "definition": "Returning quickly to original shape after force is applied; <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/elastic\" title=\"elastic\">elastic</a>. \n<ol><li><span class=\"usage-label-sense\" about=\"#mwt14\" typeof=\"mw:Transclusion\"></span> Having the ability to absorb energy when deformed.</li></ol>"
