          },
          {
            "definition": "Returning quickly to normal after damaging events or conditions. \n\n<ol><li><span class=\"usage-label-sense\" about=\"#mwt17\" typeof=\"mw:Transclusion\"></span> Having the ability to recover from <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/mental_illness\" title=\"mental illness\">mental illness</a>, <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/trauma\" title=\"trauma\">trauma</a>, etc.; having <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink/Interwiki\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/resilience%20(psychology)\" title=\"w:resilience (psychology)\" class=\"extiw\">resilience</a>.</li></ol>"
